	(text "AdeptBT rev 0.12 — JLCPCB-first schematic\\nMCU U1 Raytac MDBT50Q-1MV2  |  U2/U3 TMC2209-LA  |  U4 AP63205  |  U5 MCP73871  |  U6 AMS1117\\nPower: VIN_RAW→F1 PPTC→Q1 AO3407→D1 SMBJ24A→VIN→buck→+5V→LDO→+3V3; charger on +5V/VBAT\\nJumpers JP_V+1 (3V3/V+/VIN), JP_VM1/2 (VIN/VM); holes M1–M4; CC Rd 5.1k\\nGPIO lock: AIN0-3=P0.02-05; OUT1/2=P0.06/08; TMC_UART=P0.14; CHG_STAT=P0.25"
